    "html": "<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"/help-assets/search.png\" alt=\"Quick Search modal showing live typo-tolerant product matches\"></p>\n<p>Itemized uses SQLite FTS5 trigram indexing so you can find products even with partial words or minor typos.</p>\n<h2 id=\"quick-search-and-mobile-search\">Quick Search and mobile Search</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Desktop</strong>: Click <strong>Quick Search</strong> in the sidebar to open the search modal, type a partial product name, and click a result to jump directly to its detail page.</li>\n<li><strong>Mobile</strong>: Tap <strong>Search</strong> in the bottom dock to open the dedicated <code>/search</code> view. Navigating back from a product detail page restores your previous query and results automatically.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"keyboard-shortcuts\">Keyboard shortcuts</h2>\n<p>Press <code>?</code> anywhere outside an input field to toggle the keyboard shortcuts cheat sheet, or press <code>g</code> then <code>?</code> to open the full in-app Help center.</p>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\" tabindex=\"0\"><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Shortcut</th>\n<th>Action</th>\n<th>Description</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>g i</code></td>\n<td>In Stock</td>\n<td>Open the In Stock inventory view</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>g s</code></td>\n<td>Shopping List</td>\n<td>Open the Shopping List view</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>g d</code></td>\n<td>Due Soon</td>\n<td>Open the Due Soon inventory view</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>g o</code></td>\n<td>Overdue</td>\n<td>Open the Overdue inventory view</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>g a</code></td>\n<td>All Items</td>\n<td>Open the All Items inventory view</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>g ?</code></td>\n<td>Open Help</td>\n<td>Open the in-app Help center</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>n</code></td>\n<td>New Product</td>\n<td>Create a new product</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Esc</code></td>\n<td>Back / Close</td>\n<td>Close open dialogs or return to Inventory</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>?</code></td>\n<td>Shortcuts Cheat Sheet</td>\n<td>Toggle the keyboard shortcuts cheat sheet</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</div>",
    "searchText": "Search and keyboard shortcuts Find products instantly with typo-tolerant FTS5 search and navigate desktop views with Gmail-style shortcuts. Itemized uses SQLite FTS5 trigram indexing so you can find products even with partial words or minor typos. Quick Search and mobile Search Desktop: Click Quick Search in the sidebar to open the search modal, type a partial product name, and click a result to jump directly to its detail page. Mobile: Tap Search in the bottom dock to open the dedicated /search view. Navigating back from a product detail page restores your previous query and results automatically. Keyboard shortcuts Press ? anywhere outside an input field to toggle the keyboard shortcuts cheat sheet, or press g then ? to open the full in-app Help center. Shortcut Action Description g i In Stock Open the In Stock inventory view g s Shopping List Open the Shopping List view g d Due Soon Open the Due Soon inventory view g o Overdue Open the Overdue inventory view g a All Items Open the All Items inventory view g ? Open Help Open the in-app Help center n New Product Create a new product Esc Back / Close Close open dialogs or return to Inventory ? Shortcuts Cheat Sheet Toggle the keyboard shortcuts cheat sheet"
